url: https://github.com/Abolfazlrwm/IUT_Food/releases/latest
abstract: >-
  IUT-Food is a campus food-ordering system built with Qt 6/C++17:
  a Qt Widgets desktop client (restaurants, menus, wallet, coupons,
  live order tracking, reviews, admin console with CSV export) and a
  TCP server speaking newline-delimited JSON over optional TLS, with
  session-token auth, PBKDF2 password hashing, rate limiting, SQLite
  storage (WAL), rolling backups, a JSONL audit trail and Prometheus
  metrics. Ships for Windows, Linux, macOS and Android.
keywords:
  - Qt
  - C++17
  - SQLite
  - TCP
  - TLS
  - food-ordering
  - campus
